          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogosasiima gokorerwe aase aamo oka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya naro amachiiko na emeroberio echiikire moraigwere na gokora ase ense eyi’Omonene, Nyasae bw’echisokoro chiaino, agochia kobaa ebe eyaino. Ase amatuko onsi moraabe momenyete ase ense mobe mokoyaigwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero moraike ase ense eria y’ebisaku na koyeira, rirorio motagore na gosaria kegima aase onsi ase ebisaku ebio biarenge gosasiimera chinyasae chiabo, keraabe ase ebitunwa ebitambe, gose ase ebigoro, gose inse y’emete emebese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Motagore ebisasimero biabo, mobutore chisiiro chiabo bagosasiima, mosambe n’omorero emete y’Asera, enyasae yabo enkuungu, mogeeche na koiyeria emegwekano ye’chinyasae chiabo ebaachire. Mosirie amarieta ye’chinyasae echio chiebwe kegima, tichisasiimwa naende aase agwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero mogosasiima Omonene Nyasae oino, timobaisa gokora buna abanto abwo bagokora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene Nyasae oino, nachoore aase aamo oka korwa ase ebisaku biaino bionsi, na aroro agwo ’nabeeke erieta riaye, na obomenyo bwaye nao agwo boraabe. Aase agwo nao inwe morarigie mogendeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo nao moraarente ebing’wanso biaino bi’ogosambwa, na ebing’wanso binde, na ensemo yaino ya ikomi, na okoruegwa mokorenta, na ebi mwarierete Omonene eira komoruera, na okoruegwa kwaino kw’ogwancha, ne’bitangi biaino bi’echiombe, ne’ching’ondi, ne’chimbori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo nao morabiriere ase obosio bw’Omonene Nyasae oino, nainwe ’namobe n’omogooko amo n’abanto b’echinka chiaino, ase ebitoki bionsi moranyore ase emeremo yaino, ekiagera Omonene Nyasae oino, obasesenirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase ekero keria timobaisa gokora buna togokora bono aiga. Kera omonto nigo agokora buna arooche omonyene ng’a ’mboronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe timoraika ase moraabe n’obotoereru n’aase ense eri’Omonene Nyasae oino, agochia kobaa ebe omwando oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero moramboke Yorodani na komenya ase ense eri’Omonene Nyasae oino, agochia kobaa ebe omwando oino, naende ekero arabae obotoereru korwa ase ababisa baino bonsi baabaetanaine, erio ’namomenye ase omorembe ase motaabe n’obwoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aase agwo Omonene Nyasae oino, arachoore abe obomenyo bw’erieta riaye, nao moraarente ebinto bionsi nabachiikire: ebing’wanso biaino bi’ogosambwa, na ebing’wanso binde, n’enseemo yaino ya ikomi, na okoruegwa konde moraarente, na ebiegwa mwarierete Omonene eira komoruera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aroro agwo mogooke ase obosio bw’Omonene Nyasae oino, amo nabana baino, abamura na abaiseke, na Abalawi bamenyete amo nainwe ase emechie yaino, ekiagera Abalawi tibabwati egetari gose omwando bw’orogongo amo nainwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwerende mono, timobaisa koruera ebing’wanso biaino bi’ogosambwa aase aande onsi mokorora na gochoora inwe abanyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende moruere ebing’wanso biaino bi’ogosambwa aase ari’Omonene arachoore korwa ase orogongo rw’ebisaku biaino; agwo nao morakorere aya onsi nabachiikire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende agwo ase emechie yaino nabo moranyaare konyenya ching’iti chiaino na koria chinyama buna moganetie koreng’ana buna Omonene Nyasae oino, abasesenirie. Onde bwensi, oyo otachenegeti na oy’ochenegete, nabe ne’ribaga ri’ogochiria buna mokoria chinyama chie chingabi, na echie chinsune.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende timobaisa koria amanyinga; goika moyaitere ase riroba buna amaache.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo ase momenyete ase emechie yaino timobaisa korierao ensemo ya ikomi y’endagera yaino, gose ey’edivai, gose ey’amaguta y’amazeituni, gose ebintangi biaino bi’echiombe, ne’ching’ondi, ne’chimbori, gose ebi mwarierete Omonene eira komoruera, gose okoruegwa kwaino kw’ogwancha, gose okoruegwa konde gwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende moriere ebinto ebio ase obosio bw’Omonene Nyasae oino, agwo aase arachoore. Mobirie inwe amo nabana baino, abamura na abaiseke, na abasomba baino, abamura na abaiseke, na Abalawi bamenyete amo nainwe ase emechie yaino. Na igo mogooke ase obosio bw’Omonene Nyasae oino, ase kera egento moraabe mogokora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa gotiga gokonya Abalawi ase chingaki chionsi moragenderere komenya ase ense yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero Omonene Nyasae oino, arabagareerie orogongo rwaino buna abarierete eira, nainwe mokwane: ’Natorie chinyama, ekiagera more abatoonu b’okogania chinyama, nabo morarie chinyama, morie chinyinge buna moraganie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aase agwo Omonene Nyasae oino, arachoore kobeeka erieta riaye, karabe aare nase momenyete, nabo moranyaare konyenya eng’iti ende yonsi ye’chiombe chiaino, gose chimbori, gose ching’ondi, echi’Omonene abaeire, buna nabachiikire. Naboigo morarie chinyama chinyinge buna moraganie, ekero more agwo ase emechie yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onde bwensi, oy’otachenegeti n’oyochenegete n’abe ne ribaga ri’okoria chinyama echio, nigo morachirie buna chinyama chie chingabi gose echie chinsune chikoriegwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwerende timobaisa koria amanyinga, ekiagera obomoyo nigo bore ase amanyinga ime, timoria, obomoyo amo n’enyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timoyaria, korende nigo morayaitere ase riroba buna amaache.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwerende, timoyaria. Ekero morakore ayaare amaronge ase obosio bw’Omonene nigo er’abe buya ase more n’aase ororeeria rwaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebinto biaino moraatanane bibe ebichenu amo nebi mwariete chiira ng’a ’mobirue, mobiire aase agwo Omonene arachoore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morue ebing’wanso biaino bi’ogosambwa, chinyama amo n’amanyinga, igoro ase egesasiimero kia Omonene Nyasae oino. Amanyinga y’ebing’wanso biaino binde, moyaumore igoro ase egesasiimero kia Omonene Nyasae oino, korende chinyama chirochio morie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moigwere amang’ana aya onsi nabachiikire, erio nario er’abe buya ase more, na ase ororeeria rwaino kare na kare; ekiagera ekero morakore igo, obwo nabwo oboronge na amaya ase obosio bw’Omonene Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokuurerwa kw’ogotasasiima emegwekano y’ogosasiimwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonene Nyasae oino, naseerie korwa ase amasio aino abanto b’ebisaku ebio mogochia koira ense yabo na koyemenya. Magega Omonene kabasiririe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.29"
