              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa gosasiima Omonene Nyasae oino, buna barabwo barenge gosasiima chinyasae chiabo. Barabwo nigo barenge gokora ase chinyasae chiabo kera egento kere okogeechia, eke Nyasae ageechete. Nigo bagosamba n’omorero abana baabo, abamura na abaiseke, babe ebing’wanso ase chinyasae chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.31"
            ]
